WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.700
exchange launches four threads.

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:13.745
Every thread writes its shared slot and reaches __syncthreads before the readers condition. readers changes who consumes the values, not who must participate in the barrier.

00:00:15.245 --> 00:00:17.005
Publish shared values.

00:00:17.005 --> 00:00:19.470
All four threads supply a value.

00:00:19.470 --> 00:00:20.525
All arrive.

00:00:20.525 --> 00:00:23.150
Keep the barrier outside t < readers.

00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:24.780
Selected threads read.

00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:27.170
Only the consumer set changes.

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:32.330
Resident threads can wait for other threads at a block barrier.

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:36.430
Enough hardware resources alone do not repair a missing participant.

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:40.355
This safe kernel keeps the barrier outside the conditional reads.
